#==============================================================================================
#
#   async_iterator - WebIDL::AsyncIterator: the default asynchronous iterator objects
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/WebIDL/AsyncIterator.cpp (lines 1-217) and AsyncIterator.h
#       (lines 1-118). The iterator is a platform object whose next() and return() run on JS
#       promises: its construction and edges are here, the iteration steps come with luce-js
#       (phase 3).
